{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15206370","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15206370","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1520637001:1":{"text":"Seeing Matthew like this... *sigh*.","source_cn":"马修这副样子……唉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46B18D19F1F44323","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1520637002:1":{"text":"I'll go get the medic. Wait for me here.","source_cn":"我去找军医来帮他治疗一下，请稍等。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2533AFD0C282BFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:4:1520637003:0":{"text":"After taking a sobering potion, Matthew stops muttering Keira's name and just sits there in silence.","source_cn":"在服用过令人清醒的药剂后，马修不再念叨奎莉的名字，只是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96EFEEC037909EEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1520637004:1":{"text":"He's still out of it. He won't answer any of our questions.","source_cn":"他还是这样疯疯癫癫的，无论我们问什么都不回答。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5DB90ACAA7116CF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1520637005:1":{"text":"Seeing him like this, I feel like I've failed Keira...","source_cn":"看到他这副样子，我都感觉对不起奎莉……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB2B6FBC56D697DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1520637005":{"text":"Seeing him like this, I feel like I've failed Keira...","source_cn":"看到他这副样子，我都感觉对不起奎莉……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB2B6FBC56D697DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1520637006:0":{"text":"I know. But seeing my comrade's father like this...","source_cn":"我当然知道，但看到战友的父亲这样……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80984CC0CCDBF937","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1520637007:0":{"text":"I can't imagine what it would be like to go through what he has.","source_cn":"我不敢想象如果我面临和他一样的遭遇，那会是什么样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x526E705EAA8A86D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1520637009:0":{"text":"...No, it's not here... Where is it?!... I want to... one more time...","source_cn":"……不在这里，不在这里……我想要……再一次……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CA0D4DBE994CA63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1520637010:0":{"text":"Matthew, you ate too many petal umbrella. You must know they cause hallucinations.","source_cn":"你吃了那么多弥纹花伞，肯定知道它能致幻。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3808EB83FEA07890","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1520637011:1":{"text":"Why did you use them to make candy?","source_cn":"为什么要用它来制糖？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA6E363ABCFF5931","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1520637012:1":{"text":"Gone... all gone...","source_cn":"不见了……都不见了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1406BAB028600ADB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1520637013:1":{"text":"Candy, food, gifts from god...\n<sad>My child... my child...</sad>","source_cn":"糖果，食物，神赐……\\n<sad>我的……我的孩子……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD42944192D891EED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:18:1520637013":{"text":"Candy, food, gifts from god...\n<sad>My child... my child...</sad>","source_cn":"糖果，食物，神赐……\\n<sad>我的……我的孩子……</sad>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD42944192D891EED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1520637014:1":{"text":"...\nKeira... My daughter...","source_cn":"……\\n奎……奎莉。我的女儿……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E2452A4912425A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1520637015:1":{"text":"Keira... look, daddy remembers... I remember when the God of Harvest saved you as a child!","source_cn":"奎莉……看，爸爸记得……记得丰饶神救你的神迹！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF95FFB903372DEBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1520637016:1":{"text":"He'll definitely... save you again...","source_cn":"他一定会……再救你一次……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x017C6BBB67DE1EC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1520637017:1":{"text":"Matthew, you have to face the truth...","source_cn":"马修，接受现实吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0E120616450A017","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1520637018:1":{"text":"Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, he seems to be holding a letter...","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x10252D7E2848880B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, he seems to be holding a letter...","female":"Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, he seems to be holding a letter...","variant_male_record_index":"182962","variant_female_record_index":"182963","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:25::2":{"text":"Torn Letter","source_cn":"破碎的信纸","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0338EA9BC7E70643","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1520637019:1":{"text":"But it's really torn up... I can't make out what it says.","source_cn":"但是破损得很厉害……加拉看不清上面写了什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08E5D6E04795987F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:28:1520637019":{"text":"But it's really torn up... I can't make out what it says.","source_cn":"但是破损得很厉害……加拉看不清上面写了什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08E5D6E04795987F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1520637020:0":{"text":"Okay.","source_cn":"好。<key:dialog9>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37A7F9161D397200","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:28:0:1":{"text":"Let's try to <style=\"highlight\">piece it back together</style>.","source_cn":"试着<style=highlight>把碎片重新拼起来</style>吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x130971DB319923A1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Let's try to <style=\"highlight\">piece it back together</style>.","female":"Let's try to <style=\"highlight\">piece it back together</style>.","variant_male_record_index":"77796","variant_female_record_index":"77797","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:18:0:1":{"text":"Did you see Keira in your hallucinations?","source_cn":"你是不是想在幻觉里见到奎莉？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2D2DC659EF8EE491","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Did you see Keira in your hallucinations?","female":"Did you see Keira in your hallucinations?","variant_male_record_index":"77794","variant_female_record_index":"77795","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"Don't blame yourself.","source_cn":"别太自责，这和你无关","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x024BBD26464AE200","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Don't blame yourself.","female":"Don't blame yourself.","variant_male_record_index":"77790","variant_female_record_index":"77791","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1520637008:0":{"text":"Go ahead. I trust you won't harm him.","source_cn":"请自便吧。我相信你们不会伤害他。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x325BFF537F0B4531","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:1:2":{"text":"We want to talk to him.","source_cn":"我们有些话想问他","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB03BAAEC47DE7B7F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"We want to talk to him.","female":"We want to talk to him.","variant_male_record_index":"77792","variant_female_record_index":"77793","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_tit